# Yarus, Roar of the Old Gods: "Whenever a face-down creature you control dies, return it to the battlefield face down under its
# owner's control if it's a permanent card, then turn it face up" (CR 708.2a, 708.8). Bot1 has Yarus and two face-down disguise
# creatures, Vengeful Creeper and Basilica Stalker. Turn 4 Bot2's Pyroclasm kills both 2/2s together (Yarus, a 4/4, lives):
# Yarus triggers for each. Each comes back face down and is turned face up - the Creeper's "When this creature is turned face
# up" then destroys Bot2's Mox Jet - so Bot1 ends with the 5/5 Creeper and the 3/4 flying Stalker, both untapped, and nothing
# in the graveyard but its Black Lotus.

